# 11. Store Management Screen

Route:

```text
/admin/stores
```

Purpose:

* Discover stores
* Monitor stores
* Search stores
* Filter stores
* Perform lifecycle operations
* Open Store Details
* Create stores

Page structure:

```text
Stores
├── Header
├── Summary Cards
├── Search / Filters
├── Store Table
├── Bulk Actions
└── Pagination
```

---

# 12. Header

Display:

```text
Stores

Manage all stores across the platform.

[Search] [Filters] [Columns] [Create Store]
```

Optional:

```text
Import
Export
Bulk Actions
```

Only expose actions permitted by RBAC.

---

# 13. Summary Cards

Show:

```text
Total Stores
Active
Provisioning
Suspended
Maintenance
Failed
Archived
```

Use backend aggregate queries.

Do not calculate global counts from the current paginated browser dataset.

