# 14. Store Table

Recommended columns:

```text
Store
Owner/Vendor
Type
Location
Domain
Status
Products
Inventory
Orders
Revenue
Created
Actions
```

Store identity:

```text
Logo
Store Name
Store Code
```

Example:

```text
Urban Fashion
UF-DHK-001
```

---

# 15. Search

Search by:

```text
Store Name
Store Code
Vendor
Domain
Email
Phone
Address
```

Search must be server-side for large datasets.

---

# 16. Filters

Support:

```text
Status
Vendor
Store Type
Country
Region
City
Domain Status
POS Enabled
Online Store Enabled
Warehouse
Payment Provider
Shipping Provider
Created Date
Updated Date
```

Advanced filters may include:

